<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Offline · Collective Spirits of Montclair</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#050f0a">
    <%# Styles are inline: this page has to render when the network — and
        possibly the cached stylesheet — isn't there. %>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        background: #13261b;
        color: #c9a968;
        font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .seal {
        width: 96px;
        height: 96px;
        margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 2px solid rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.5);
        background: rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.1);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
      .label {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.75);
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
      }
      p.body {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.85);
        margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        max-width: 28rem;
      }
      button {
        font: inherit;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #c9a968;
        background: rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.15);
        border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.6);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      button:active { background: rgba(201, 169, 104, 0.25); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="seal" aria-hidden="true">&#129347;</div>
      <p class="label">No connection</p>
      <h1>The cellar is out of reach</h1>
      <p class="body">
        You&rsquo;re offline, so tonight&rsquo;s pour can&rsquo;t be loaded. Ratings and RSVPs need a
        connection &mdash; try again once you&rsquo;re back on.
      </p>
      <button type="button" onclick="window.location.reload()">Try again</button>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
